# freshness-detector thresholds - copy to freshness-thresholds.conf (gitignored:
# it names sites) beside freshness-detector.sh.  `<key> <minutes>` per line.

# required: the detector will not scan without all three
default       20    # stale after this long without a knx2 point
cooldown      20    # wait after the first restart of a stale spell, doubling ...
cooldown_max  240   # ... up to this cap (matches hamon's own 4h back-off cap)

# optional: new-site grace period. A site whose first data is younger than this
# is reported (NEW) but never restarted, so a quiet new site is left alone until
# its normal traffic is known. Default 1440 (24h); 0 turns it off.
#grace        1440

# optional per-site thresholds (location name exactly as in Influx), for
# low-traffic sites whose normal quiet spells are longer than `default`
#example_site 720
